<body>
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
  <symbol id="sh" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1.5l5 2v4c0 3.2-2.2 5.6-5 6.9C5.2 13.1 3 10.7 3 7.5v-4z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M5.8 8l1.6 1.6 3-3.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="bolt" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M9 1.5L3.5 9H8l-1 5.5L12.5 7H8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></symbol>
</svg>


<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="pill"><img src="media/yuri-profile.jpg" alt="">Pra quem quer postar todo dia sem saber editar vídeo</div>
  <h1>Você digita o tema. <span class="o">O vídeo sai pronto pra postar.</span></h1>
  <div class="demo vsl" id="demo">
    <video id="film" src="media/vsl97-720.mp4?v=6" poster="media/vsl97-poster.jpg?v=6"
      autoplay muted playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="auto" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback
      controlslist="nodownload noplaybackrate noremoteplayback nofullscreen" x-webkit-airplay="deny"></video>
    <div class="shield" id="shield"></div>
    <div class="paused-ico" aria-hidden="true"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M7 4.5v15l13-7.5z"/></svg></span></div>
    <button class="unmute" id="unmute" type="button" aria-label="Ativar o som do vídeo">
      <span class="box">
        <span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
